# Local secrets: deployment env files and bearer-token files. No Dockerfile
# copies them, but without these lines they are still sent to the Docker daemon
# as build context. Example and template env files stay included.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.*.example
!**/.env.template
.token*
.scratchpad/
# Agent tooling. Git tracks only .claude/skills/, but Docker does not read
# .gitignore, so worktrees (full repo copies with their own secrets) would be
# sent as build context. No image needs anything under .claude/.
.claude/
# frontend/build/ - KEEP THIS, needed by registry service
